# # /aeco/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the Aecoware Open Taxonomy, an open SKOS taxonomy
# for architecture, engineering, construction and operations.
#
# https://w3id.org/aeco/ and every concept IRI under it, such as
# https://w3id.org/aeco/aeco-01008, redirect to https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/
# RDF clients get Turtle or JSON-LD. Browsers get the explorer, opened at the concept.
# https://w3id.org/aeco/mappings gives the links to outside standards in Turtle.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Roman Makarov
# roman@aecoware.com
# GitHub username: odb88

RewriteEngine on

# Links to outside standards
RewriteRule ^mappings$ https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/aeco-mappings.ttl [R=303,L]

# Turtle
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^ https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/aeco.ttl [R=303,L]

# JSON-LD
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^ https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/aeco.jsonld [R=303,L]

# Browsers and everything else: the explorer, opened at the concept when one is named
RewriteRule ^(aeco-[0-9]{5})$ https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/#$1 [R=303,NE,L]
RewriteRule ^ https://aecoware.github.io/aecxonomy/ [R=303,L]
